{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "edc60aac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Smart Notes Generator\n",
    "Lecture audio / transcript / PDF → structured notes. \n",
    "\n",
    "User can choose anyone LLM provider: **OpenAI** or **Gemini**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline: `load → (ASR if audio) → chunk → map (notes per chunk) → reduce (merge) → markdown`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "411cd213",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "48641082",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# %pip install langchain==1.3.6 langchain-google-genai==4.4.0 langchain-text-splitters==1.1.2\n",
    "\n",
    "."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c36a5a0c-8b6c-452b-b606-a337af233beb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
