  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4d31ffe5-87b4-4e54-b24c-f56a31bcbef1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Install torch, transformers and ffmpeg only if you need to use huggingface model for speech-to-text\n",
    "- In alternative, You can use OpenAI API to access other speech-to-text models. This way you do not need to install above package"
   ]
  },
